1.2 PRICE-TIME PRIORITY
-----------------------
NSE order matching rules:
- Price priority: Better prices matched first
- Time priority: Same price, earliest order matched first

Queue Position Effects:
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Action                  │ Impact on Queue Position                     │
├─────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Price modification      │ Loses time priority (sent to back)          │
│ Quantity increase       │ Loses time priority (sent to back)          │
│ Quantity decrease       │ Typically retains time priority             │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

